<title>FINLAND: Nokian Renkaat eight-month profit rises.</title>
<headline>Nokian Renkaat eight-month profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items,tax   52 vs 41</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	     3.38 vs 3.11</p>
<p> Net sales					652 vs 630</p>
<p> Operating profit				66 vs 55</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts median forecast profit after financial items was 49 million markka (mean 50 million) in a 48 million to 55 million markka range.</p>
</text>
